          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Research skills mean finding reliable sources, judging them, comparing what they say and summarising the answer briefly with references, and you build them by writing a one-page research note on a real question and having someone check each claim."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Choose a question, gather sources of different types, check dates and authors, and write a short note with sources listed."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Follow the format your college or employer uses."
          }
        ]
      },
